pmdocs (1.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Always bundle and install the payload-markdown skill next to
    payload-markdown-docs.
    - Vendored in skills/payload-markdown, so every build ships it, Homebrew
      included.
    - pmdocs install skill prefers the project's node_modules/payload-markdown
      (either package name) and fails when neither copy is available.
  * Add pmdocs skill check and pmdocs skill update; installed skills carry a
    skill.json manifest. validate and plan warn on stderr when the installed
    skill is outdated.
  * pmdocs install routes imports the plugin under the package name the app
    depends on.
  * Build with vl-release; the Homebrew formula builds from the release source
    archive.

 -- Valkyrian Labs <maintainers@valkyrianlabs.com>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 00:02:14 +0000

